  <item nodeId="node-202">
    <command xml:space="preserve"> </command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Desert Highway - Bus Stop&#x000A;The dawn begins to unfold in purples and light blues. You stand at an empty bus stop off of a back country desert road, waiting in the chill of the arriving day. You check your phone-- no service. Not that it matters, they'll be confiscating your phone first thing.</result>
