  <item nodeId="node-203">
    <command xml:space="preserve"> </command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You squint, looking eastward towards the rising sun. At the vanishing point of the highway you see a growing plume of dust. Looks like your ride is on the way.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;Please press SPACE to continue.</result>
