  <item nodeId="node-561">
    <command xml:space="preserve">finish</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">"OK." says Doctor Brigh, "That's enough for today. They'll take you back to the rendezvous."&#x000A;&#x000A; The Doctor gestures to the door as it swings open, revealing a gaggle of agents (special or otherwise) who all look frighteningly similar to Special Agent Howard. You stand.&#x000A;&#x000A;DAY 1.&#x000A;&#x000A;Desert Highway - Bus Stop&#x000A;temp desc</result>
