  <item nodeId="node-590">
    <command xml:space="preserve">tell brigh about mortality</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You report on your notes on Mortality. Brigh scribbles away on his notebook, nodding intermittently.&#x000A;Life and Mortality&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-591">
    <command xml:space="preserve">tell brigh nothing</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You tell Brigh that you have nothing to add to your report.&#x000A;&#x000A;Brigh frowns. "My understanding was you'd be providing detailed insight on the subject. This isn't a vacation. This data that you're providing is vital to national security-- no: global safety."</result>
