  <item nodeId="node-607">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ask brigh about procedure</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Brigh looks relieved that you skip the pleasantries.&#x000A;&#x000A;You ask Doctor Brigh about the facility procedures. &#x000A;&#x000A;Doctor Brigh sighs heavily. "What do you want to know about? The output limit? The errant input warning? The intelligence?"&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
