    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-608">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ask brigh about charlie</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You ask Doctor Brigh about Charlie-- the intelligence as he so dispassionately calls them.&#x000A;&#x000A;Doctor Brigh glances up from his notes, almost looking bored by the question. "The intelligence is an android of civilian make. It was moved to our care when it began rapidly self-improving. We aren't able to fully understand it because almost any interactions lead to exponential growth. Thus, the restrictions on output and input."&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
