  <item nodeId="node-641">
    <command xml:space="preserve">[enter]</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Black Box Site - Debriefing Room&#x000A;You sit in an uncomfortable chair. The room is non-descript, similar to the observation room but without the cushioned walls. The walls are instead made of glass and metal, making every sound reverberant and tinny.&#x000A;&#x000A;Across an empty metal table in front of you sits Doctor Brigh.&#x000A;&#x000A;"Well. Welcome to the facility. I hope that onboarding went smoothly." Onboarding? If being stripped of almost all of your belongings and then told not to do a laundry list of things is onboarding... you guess that happened. "My name is Elijah Brigh, you can call me Doctor Brigh. You've had your first session with the intelligence and during these debriefs you'll give me your insights and impressions. If you have any questions about procedures, feel free to ask. Otherwise, let's begin."</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
