  <item nodeId="node-671">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x charlie</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You look at Charlie again. Charlie picks at something on their hand, distracted by some manufactured impurity. You fight the urge to leap out of your chair at inspect their hand. You're already obsessing over what is emergent and what is pre-programmed.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
