    <command xml:space="preserve">x charlie</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You look at Charlie again. They were manufactured to look organized and kempt but not perfect. Their nails are trimmed but have edges where they look to have been cut... Could their nails truly grow?&#x000A;&#x000A;[if you are feeling stuck, check your notes with "check notes" or "check note on specific topic."]&#x000A;&gt;</result>
