  <item nodeId="node-683">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x charlie</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You look at Charlie again. Charlie smiles slightly as they catch you observing them. You glance away nervously before thinking about how ridiculous it is to be bashful in an interaction with a computer. You look back at Charlie and they look back at you. You suddenly feel quite guilty for thinking of them as a computer.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
