  <item nodeId="node-755">
    <command xml:space="preserve">tell brigh about nothing</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You tell Brigh that you have nothing to add to your report. &#x000A;&#x000A;Brigh frowns deeply. "Consider this a final warning. We brought you here to make an evaluation and if you are not able to deliver daily reports then we have no use for you in this facility. Not to mention, I'd be giving a scathing review to my peers who recommended you." He glares at you with eyes that say, "You will never work in this industry again."</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-756"/>
    </children>
  </item>
