  <item nodeId="node-761">
    <command xml:space="preserve">[enter]</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Black Box Site - Debriefing Room&#x000A;You're back in the odd, uncomfortable debrief room.&#x000A;&#x000A;Across the metal table sits Doctor Brigh.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;[19] tell brigh about life&#x000A;Brigh looks relieved that you skip the pleasantries.&#x000A;&#x000A;You read off your notes on life. As you drone on dispassionately, Brigh takes notes but gives no response otherwise.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;[20] tell brigh about death&#x000A;You read off your notes on mortality. As you drone on dispassionately, Brigh takes notes but gives no response otherwise.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;[21] finish&#x000A;"OK." says Doctor Brigh, "That's enough for today. They'll take you back to the rendezvous."&#x000A;&#x000A;The Doctor gestures to the door as it swings open, revealing a gaggle of agents (special or otherwise) who all look frighteningly similar to Special Agent Howard. You stand.</result>
