  <item nodeId="node-891">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Black Box Site - Hallway&#x000A;Special Agent Howard continues to stand at attention. You wonder how long you could wait here before he cracks.&#x000A;&#x000A;The hallway stretches seemingly infinitely to the east and west and there is a solitary red door to the north, only a few feet away.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-892"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-892">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x howard</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Special Agent Howard is clean shaven and square jawed. Though he carries himself with a rigid, militaristic authority he looks barely old enough to have a bachelors degree. You can tell that he notices you examining him but he does not glance towards you but stares straight ahead at the red door.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-893"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-893">
    <command xml:space="preserve">say hello to howard</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You nod tersely to Special Agent Howard. He nods tersely back at you.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-894"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-894">
    <command xml:space="preserve">enter door</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The door swings open silently and you enter the--&#x000A;&#x000A;Black Box Site - Observation Room&#x000A;The room is about 20 feet by 20 feet. The floor is the same polished concrete as the hallway outside but the walls are padded with some sort of white cushioning.&#x000A;&#x000A;In the center of the room are two white, plastic chairs. Seated in the right chair is Charlie. Charlie is dressed all in white linen and they look up at you absently as you enter.&#x000A;&#x000A;You cross the room and seat yourself opposite from Charlie, crossing one leg over the other and pulling out your notebook.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-895"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-895">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x charlie</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">If you didn't already know otherwise... you would never be able to tell that Charlie is not human. Their dark brown eyes flit back and forth between yours with instinctual humanity. Their skin looks soft and porous. As they wait for you to speak, they clasp their hands together in their lap as if to assure you of their patience. They cock their head to the side and sit up slightly in their chair. You almost laugh in astonishment. They are exquisite.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-896"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-896">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x charlie</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You look at Charlie again. Their eyes are a dark brown, almost black. You lock eyes with them briefly and they glance away, seeming to feign self-consciousness. Perhaps it isn't an act?&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-897"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-897">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x charlie</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You look at Charlie again. Charlie cranes their neck ever so slightly to get a glimpse of the open page of your notebook. When they see you looking at them they quickly look away.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-898"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-898">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x charlie</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You look at Charlie again. Their eyes are a dark brown, almost black. You lock eyes with them briefly and they glance away, seeming to feign self-consciousness. Perhaps it isn't an act?&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
