  <item nodeId="node-988">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ask charlie about researchers</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You ask Charlie about the researchers. The people who are studying them.&#x000A;&#x000A;"Well, I've never met them. Not like-- Not how we've met." Charlie gestures at you and them by waving a finger between you both. "I know some of their names and I've heard some of their voices." Charlie sighs, trailing off. They seem somewhat bored by this subject.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-989"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-989">
    <command xml:space="preserve">tell charlie about jesus</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Before you can get out the first half of a sentence the room darkens to near pitch black.</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-990"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-990">
    <command xml:space="preserve">[enter]</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">BRRRRMM! --with an ominous, booming, buzzing sound; the room is suddenly filled with sinister red light.&#x000A;&#x000A;"ERRANT OUTPUT DETECTED. ERRANT OUTPUT DETECTED. ALL HUMANS EVACUATE THE OBSERVATION CHAMBER. ALL HUMANS EVACUATE THE OBSERVATION CHAMBER."&#x000A;&#x000A;You wince as the loud robotic voice encourages you to evacuate. You stand and look down at Charlie. They shrug but they don't get out of their chair. You head out the way you came.</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-991"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-991">
    <command xml:space="preserve">[enter]</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Black Box Site - Unmarked Room&#x000A;You sit in an uncomfortable chair. The room is non-descript, similar to the observation room but without the cushioned walls. The walls are instead made of glass and metal, making every sound reverberant and tinny.&#x000A;&#x000A;Across an empty metal table in front of you sits Doctor Brigh.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-992"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-992">
    <command xml:space="preserve">tell brigh about life</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">As you speak, Brigh takes notes. He nods a few times but otherwise is silent.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
