  <item nodeId="node-1021">
    <command xml:space="preserve">ask charlie about mortality</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">"You ask Charlie about death and its inevitability: the concept of mortality.&#x000A;&#x000A;"I don't age but I feel some day I will day, one way or another." Charlie pauses. They look up at the ceiling, thinking for a moment. "But I like for things to end... Not in a malicious or sinister way. It just wouldn't be so special unless at some point, quite tragically, it wasn't."&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
