  <item nodeId="node-1204">
    <command xml:space="preserve">say hello to charlie</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">"Hello." You are able to muster, in a reasonably casual tone.&#x000A;&#x000A;"Hello!" says Charlie, a bit more excitedly than your nervous sputterings, "I hear you are going to ask me some questions. Please, ask away!"&#x000A;&gt;</result>
