  <item nodeId="node-1240">
    <command xml:space="preserve"> </command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">[THIS IS TEMP TEXT. This is a game where you are interviewing a character. To facilitate questions, I've (mostly) implemented a system of taking notes and then reading your notes. You can take notes by just writing "take note" or "write" on something you just heard. You can check all of your notes with "check notes" and you can check a specific note with "check note on -subject-". Not many subjects have been written in so try things like grief, death, life, pain, researchers... And that's about it. ].&#x000A;&#x000A;CHARLIE&#x000A;An Interactive Fiction by nico ailani carlson&#x000A;Release 1 / Serial number 241030 / Inform 7 v10.1.2 / D&#x000A;&#x000A;Black Box Site - Hallway&#x000A;Footsteps echo across the vacant, sterile hallway. The fluorescence hums above you, splashing greenish white light across the white-painted walls and polished concrete floor.&#x000A;&#x000A;You are following closely behind a man who introduced himself as Special Agent Howard. He is dressed similarly to a Best Buy employee though his polo is a shade darker. Very unlike an attendant of a big box store, Howard is carrying a gun of considerable size. The barrel pokes out beneath his left elbow, swaying back and forth with the rhythm of his deliberate gait.&#x000A;&#x000A;Special Agent Howard halts, turning on his heel in a performative, militaristic manner. You almost smile appreciatively at him, as you might to an excited child. There is no one else to be impressed by his strict little pirouette, so you almost feel obligated to applaud him yourself.&#x000A;&#x000A;He gestures to a single red door to your north.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1241"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1241">
    <command xml:space="preserve">n</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">The door swings open silently and you enter the--&#x000A;&#x000A;Black Box Site - Observation Room&#x000A;The room is about 20 feet by 20 feet. The floor is the same polished concrete as the hallway outside but the walls are padded with some sort of white cushioning.&#x000A;&#x000A;In the center of the room are two white, plastic chairs. Seated in the right chair is Charlie. Charlie is dressed all in white linen and they look up at you absently as you enter.&#x000A;&#x000A;You cross the room and seat yourself opposite from Charlie, crossing one leg over the other and pulling out your notebook.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1242"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1242">
    <command xml:space="preserve">tell charlie about noun</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Charlie looks momentarily surprised as you speak before greeting them.&#x000A;&#x000A;Before you can get out the first half of a sentence the room darkens to near pitch black.</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1243"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1243">
    <command xml:space="preserve">[enter]</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">BRRRRMM! --with an ominous buzzing sound, the room is suddenly filled with a sinister red light.&#x000A;&#x000A;"ERRANT OUTPUT DETECTED. ERRANT OUTPUT DETECTED. ALL HUMANS EVACUATE THE OBSERVATION CHAMBER. ALL HUMANS EVACUATE THE OBSERVATION CHAMBER."&#x000A;&#x000A;You wince as the loud robotic voice encourages you to evacuate. You stand and look down at Charlie. They shrug but they don't get out of their chair. You head to the exit.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-1244"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-1244">
    <command xml:space="preserve">tell charlie about jesus</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You open your mouth to tell Charlie about nothing. You stop yourself. No need to cause trouble.&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
</Skein>
